{"1707170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sumo Tatami Prologue", "steam_appid": 1707170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our dicord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/2240708c633896b8e7f05c7023c9d569.poster.avif?t=1773873877\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/2240708c633896b8e7f05c7023c9d569.webm?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/2240708c633896b8e7f05c7023c9d569.mp4?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Sumo Tatami, where clumsy sumo wrestlers battle in fun and competitive modes! Get ready for races, duels, bowling, golf, and other sumo adventures with friends and rivals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤣 <strong>Unpredictable Sumo Action:</strong> Control a clumsy wrestler, experiencing chaos on treacherous arenas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/a6df2648308fe6ac7c66af0cbe76dcf5.poster.avif?t=1773873877\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/a6df2648308fe6ac7c66af0cbe76dcf5.webm?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/a6df2648308fe6ac7c66af0cbe76dcf5.mp4?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>Comic Weapons:</strong> Use a hilarious arsenal of weapons, from rocket launchers to harpoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥇 <strong>Competitions:</strong> Fight for the title of sumo champion in various modes filled with laughter and excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/b76ca5dad75ac5e808cb4e9569bc536a.poster.avif?t=1773873877\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/b76ca5dad75ac5e808cb4e9569bc536a.webm?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/b76ca5dad75ac5e808cb4e9569bc536a.mp4?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 <strong>Quirky Power-Ups:</strong> Grab powerful bonuses to dominate in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Countless Skins:</strong> Dress your sumo wrestler in unique outfits and masks to stand out from the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/460c7c0ba89b799a262caf3aeed4c2d5.poster.avif?t=1773873877\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/460c7c0ba89b799a262caf3aeed4c2d5.webm?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707170/extras/460c7c0ba89b799a262caf3aeed4c2d5.mp4?t=1773873877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for fun and crazy battles in Sumo Tatami - the perfect party platformer!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto